# REQUIRED, with no defaults. Docker Compose sets every one of these for the container.
# Running outside Docker, export them in your shell: uvicorn does not read this file.
# A link is a base URL, http://<host>:<port>.
#
# The journal: where each run and its attempts are kept, and a completed run's platform is published.
# JOURNAL_URL=
# retrieval, which the docs stage calls to fetch a platform's documentation.
# RETRIEVAL_URL=
# serialization-agent, which the serialization stage calls.
# SERIALIZATION_AGENT_URL=
# validator-agent, which the pim, atl and acceleo stages call to check their output.
# VALIDATOR_AGENT_URL=
# psm-agent, which the psm stage calls.
# PSM_AGENT_URL=
# atl-agent and acceleo-agent, which the atl and acceleo stages call.
# ATL_AGENT_URL=
# ACCELEO_AGENT_URL=
# execution-agent, which the generation stage calls to run the ATL and the template.
# EXECUTION_AGENT_URL=
#
# Two files of the MDE engine this service reads: the PIM metamodel, and the sample PIM
# instance the generation stage runs the ATL and the template on.
# PIM_METAMODEL_PATH=
# PIM_SAMPLE_INSTANCE_PATH=

# Optional, unset by default. Set to "1" to make the docs stage skip the real
# retrieval crawl and return canned output instantly, for iterating on the
# pipeline's mechanics (approve/reject/retry/message) without needing a
# real, valid documentation URL or waiting on a real 90+ second crawl each
# time. Leave unset for a real run, this is a local testing convenience only,
# never set it in docker-compose.yml.
# ORCHESTRATOR_STUB_DOCS=1
